  "description": "The Bedford is the everyday commuter bike that Brooklyn Bicycle Co. built for riders who want gearing without complexity. An 8-speed Shimano drivetrain gives you enough range to flatten hills on your morning ride without overwhelming you with choices. The hi-tensile steel frame pairs durability with a comfortable upright geometry that keeps your head up and eyes on the road. Dual-pivot caliper brakes deliver confident stopping in wet or dry conditions. Fender mounts come standard so you can add coverage for rainy commutes, and a rear rack mount lets you carry groceries, a laptop bag, or panniers. puncture-resistant tires handle potholed city streets without complaint. The Bedford fits riders who want one bike that handles the daily commute, weekend errands, and evening rides along the waterfront.",
